  <subsection xml:id="frq1a-2025c-messagebuilder-a">
    <title>2025 FRQ - Message Builder Part (a)</title>

    <p>
      This FRQ also uses a while loop in a manner similar to getting input from
      a user or a file.
    </p>

    <activity label="frq1a-2025-MessageBuilder-PartA">
      <statement>
        <p>
          Complete the MessageBuilder constructor below that builds a message
          starting with the startingWord specified by the parameter. It should
          use a while loop to add on to the message using the given getNextWord
          method and increment numWords. Make sure there are spaces between the
          words in the message.
        </p>
      </statement>

      <program interactive="activecode" language="java">

        <code>
          <![CDATA[
